", \"ok going back to the sitar kitty thing — the first one, who's actually in it?\", \"right, different thing, when's the bonnet?\", \"uh and the Drinine?\", \"and um the sycamore delivery?\"], [\"sitar kitty total so far?\", \"wait — any documents about Bromow?\", \"back to sitar kitty — first one, who's in it?\", \"when's the bonnet?\", \"and the Drinine?\", \"and the sycamore delivery?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0035\", \"v\": [[\"Could you send Thavmoara a message saying happy birthday, please?\"], [\"umm can you send Thavmoara a message, like, saying happy birthday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0036\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what I paid for the bobcat parts, please?\", \"Also, how much have I spent on Bromow in total, if you don't mind?\"], [\"what did i pay for the bobcat parts\", \"oh and how much have i spent on Bromow total\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0037\", \"v\": [[\"umm so how much have I spent in lacemaking share?\"], [\"how much have i spent in lacemaking share\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0038\", \"v\": [[\"lacemaking share expenses?\", \"damson one — how much?\", \"dinner one, which group?\", \"my last photo?\", \"who's in it?\", \"pics with any of them?\"], [\"what have i spent on in lacemaking share\", \"how much was the damson one\", \"and the dinner one, which group's that in\", \"diff thing, show me the last photo i took\", \"whos in it\", \"any pics with any of those ppl in\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0039\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to remember what we got up to there, so could you show me what pictures are in the Ravello Leisure Centre album?\", \"Different thing — I'm trying to work out numbers, so who is coming to the hollyhock?\", \"I might need to get in touch beforehand, so could you pull up their contact details for me?\", \"Oh, and before I forget it again — the boat shed PIN is 68393, could you keep that safe in the locker for me?\"], [\"umm what pictures are in the Ravello Leisure Centre album?\", \"ok, uh, who's coming to the hollyhock?\", \"and their… their contact details?\", \"oh and um the boat shed PIN is 68393, can you stick it in the locker?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0040\", \"v\": [[\"Thavmoara sorted a lot of the bookings for us, so I'd like to settle up with Thavmoara in Premow trip now if you can.\", \"Separate question — I'm trying to keep track of who owes what, so how much does Dariusz owe me in lacemaking share?\"], [\"settle up w Thavmoara in Premow trip pls\", \"also how much does Dariusz owe me in lacemaking share\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0041\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you add thirty francs for Thavmoara's lunch to Premow trip — I paid\", \"ok and uh how many photos did I take on the Premow trip?\", \"umm the third one — can I see the photos in it?\", \"different thing, what have I got filed under Legal?\", \"and uh what's the third one?\", \"and Dubrovnik flat?\"], [\"Could you please add thirty francs for Thavmoara's lunch to Premow trip? I paid for it.\", \"Also, could you tell me how many photos I took on the Premow trip?\", \"Would you show me the photos in the third one, please?\", \"Separately, could you tell me what I have filed under Legal?\", \"Could you tell me what the third one is?\", \"And what about Dubrovnik flat, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0042\", \"v\": [[\"um do I have any photos about cardamom?\"], [\"I'm putting together a little spice scrapbook and wondered — do I have any photos about cardamom?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0043\", \"v\": [[\"umm delete the pestle photo\", \"oh and uh can you settle up my debt with Selam?\"], [\"Could you delete the pestle photo, please?\", \"Also, would you mind settling up my debt with Selam?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0044\", \"v\": [[\"whats the steps for the pay for the knapsack\", \"tick off the first one and delete the second one\", \"also delete the lacemaking viewing appointment\", \"no wrong one, i meant the coach call one\"], [\"umm what are the steps for the, uh, pay for the knapsack?\", \"ok tick off the first one and, um, delete the second one\", \"oh and can you delete the lacemaking viewing appointment\", \"wait no, that's the wrong one — I meant the coach call one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0045\", \"v\": [[\"umm when was I last in touch with Jelena Wakefield?\", \"ok different thing — which task is, like, roughly a ten minute job?\"], [\"I feel like I've been neglecting some friends lately — when was I last in touch with Jelena Wakefield?\", \"I've got a small gap before my next thing, so which task is roughly a ten minute job?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0046\", \"v\": [[\"We've been meaning to square things away for ages, so could you settle up with Thavmoara in lacemaking share?\"], [\"Could you please settle up with Thavmoara in lacemaking share?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0047\", \"v\": [[\"Would you add thirteen francs for Thavmoara's petrol to lacemaking share, please? I paid for it.\"], [\"Thavmoara drove us over last time and I covered the fuel, so can you add thirteen francs for Thavmoara's petrol to lacemaking share? I was the one who paid.\"]]}","ttft_ms":22927,"type":"result","duration_ms":36433,"uuid":"7194b6ab-f3c9-4420-9e51-e53bb79a7af5","ttft_stream_ms":1905,"time_to_request_ms":163,"first_content_frame_ms":1905,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21926907,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278477209.998,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
